WEBVTT

00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:14.750
Last time on Dragon Ball Z, the mutating monster, Majin Buu, found himself completely outclassed by the Super Saiyan, Vegito, the radical new warrior created from the fusion of Goku and Vegeta.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.930
